; A commodity whose gnucash-fraction is not a whole number.
;
; What this fixture produces: nothing. A fraction counts the commodity's
; smallest units, so `1.5` is refused with the commodity it is on, and no book
; is written.
;
; Verified by tests/integration/test_cli_beancount.py.
2026-01-10 commodity USD
    gnucash-mnemonic: "USD"
    gnucash-namespace: "CURRENCY"
    gnucash-fullname: "US Dollar"
    gnucash-fraction: "1.5"
